	(footprint "pluto_rx2_8way_v4:RP2040_Zero_LCC23_18x23.5"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "9e915a02-a688-4123-bc97-94bbeb4d2126")
		(at 52.7 80.75 180)
		(descr "Waveshare RP2040-Zero, 23-pad castellated LCC-23 module, 18.00 x 23.50 mm, 2.54 mm pitch. NUMBERING IS THE VENDOR'S AND RUNS CLOCKWISE FROM THE TOP-RIGHT - the MIRROR of an IC. Top view, USB-C up: pad 1 = GP0 is the TOPMOST pad of the RIGHT edge, 1..9 down the right edge, 10..14 right-to-left along the bottom, 15..23 up the left edge to 5V at top-left. Source: Waveshare schematic sheet 'Pin Out' header P1 'Header 23', corroborated by the wiki FAQ calling VSYS 'Pin23' and 3V3 'Pin 21'. THE SILK PRINTS GPIO NUMBERS, NOT PAD NUMBERS, AND THEY DIVERGE AT PAD 17: pads 1-16 are GP0-GP15 (sixteen consecutive agreements, long enough to convince a reviewer the map is the identity), then 17=GP26, 18=GP27, 19=GP28, 20=GP29, 21=3V3, 22=GND, 23=5V. GRID IS SELF-PROVING: 1.59 + 8x2.54 + 1.59 = 23.50 and 3.92 + 4x2.54 + 3.92 = 18.00, so both published datums fall out of centring arithmetic alone. LAND IS AUTHORED - Waveshare publishes none. 2.60 x 1.20 rect straddling the module edge 1.00 outboard / 1.60 inboard: the inboard 1.60 reaches past the castellation hole centre at 1.38 mm (CITED number, inferred datum) so the barrel wets over its full height with 0.22 mm of placement margin; the outboard 1.00 is the ONLY inspectable feature of a castellated joint - with no tail, a joint that never wetted looks identical to one that did. Gap 1.34 mm at 2.54 pitch. NO F.PASTE APERTURES, DELIBERATELY: this part is NOT on the assembly BOM or the CPL (see 03_src/rules/assembly.yaml not_assembled, and 01_docs/decisions/0002). Paste printed under a part that is not placed reflows into solder balls. If a reflow posture is ever adopted, paste 100% of the INBOARD 1.60 mm only and never under the outboard tail. THE MODULE IS NOT FLAT-BACKED: 23 components sit on the CARRIER-FACING face - crystal 1.000 mm proud, RP2040 QFN-56 0.850, RT9013 0.700, twenty 0201s 0.300 - MEASURED off the vendor STEP. See the two keepouts drawn on Dwgs.User and Cmts.User, and 01_docs/decisions/0002.")
		(tags "RP2040 Waveshare module castellated LCC-23 2.54 18x23.5 hand-solder not-assembled")
